    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/31b0d7ed4aa059a4b5ff297bf1959c9d.avif?t=1731776783\" width=615 height=112 /></span><br><br>Discover Primavera LIHBOR: Prepare for an immersive journey where surreal dimensions collide with intricate puzzles and otherworldly threats. Dive into a world, where realism meets postmodern references, and every decision shapes your fate.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/2d9e16b38bd20f0bf89e17832dbbb620.poster.avif?t=1731776783\" width=614 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/2d9e16b38bd20f0bf89e17832dbbb620.webm?t=1731776783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/2d9e16b38bd20f0bf89e17832dbbb620.mp4?t=1731776783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging Gameplay</h2>Navigate through shifting realities, decode enigmatic puzzles, and confront hostile entities from distant dimensions. As you progress, unravel the mysteries surrounding the clandestine experiments threatening the city's existence. Will you save your sister and uncover the truth?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/1888459c848a2272737de912524905ca.poster.avif?t=1731776783\" width=614 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/1888459c848a2272737de912524905ca.webm?t=1731776783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/1888459c848a2272737de912524905ca.mp4?t=1731776783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eerie Setting</h2>Set in what initially appears as an Eastern European city, Primavera LIHBOR takes you on a journey where disaster unleashes surreal entities from other dimensions. Watch as familiar surroundings blend with the unknown, creating a perplexing landscape where realities intertwine.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/217c4655ecbea3bebfb8ec16cd774625.poster.avif?t=1731776783\" width=614 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/217c4655ecbea3bebfb8ec16cd774625.webm?t=1731776783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/217c4655ecbea3bebfb8ec16cd774625.mp4?t=1731776783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compelling Plot</h2>The chairwoman of a community watchdog organization suspects secretive experiments by the city's scientists. Unable to investigate alone, she enlists the help of her brother, Kir, a young scientist from the capital. As Kir ventures into the unknown, players must decipher clues, solve puzzles, and evade hostile entities to save his sister and uncover the truth.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/31b0d7ed4aa059a4b5ff297bf1959c9d.avif?t=1731776783\" width=615 height=112 /></span><br><br>Discover Primavera LIHBOR: Prepare for an immersive journey where surreal dimensions collide with intricate puzzles and otherworldly threats. Dive into a world, where realism meets postmodern references, and every decision shapes your fate.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/2d9e16b38bd20f0bf89e17832dbbb620.poster.avif?t=1731776783\" width=614 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/2d9e16b38bd20f0bf89e17832dbbb620.webm?t=1731776783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/2d9e16b38bd20f0bf89e17832dbbb620.mp4?t=1731776783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging Gameplay</h2>Navigate through shifting realities, decode enigmatic puzzles, and confront hostile entities from distant dimensions. As you progress, unravel the mysteries surrounding the clandestine experiments threatening the city's existence. Will you save your sister and uncover the truth?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/1888459c848a2272737de912524905ca.poster.avif?t=1731776783\" width=614 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/1888459c848a2272737de912524905ca.webm?t=1731776783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/1888459c848a2272737de912524905ca.mp4?t=1731776783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eerie Setting</h2>Set in what initially appears as an Eastern European city, Primavera LIHBOR takes you on a journey where disaster unleashes surreal entities from other dimensions. Watch as familiar surroundings blend with the unknown, creating a perplexing landscape where realities intertwine.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/217c4655ecbea3bebfb8ec16cd774625.poster.avif?t=1731776783\" width=614 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/217c4655ecbea3bebfb8ec16cd774625.webm?t=1731776783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815710/extras/217c4655ecbea3bebfb8ec16cd774625.mp4?t=1731776783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compelling Plot</h2>The chairwoman of a community watchdog organization suspects secretive experiments by the city's scientists. Unable to investigate alone, she enlists the help of her brother, Kir, a young scientist from the capital. As Kir ventures into the unknown, players must decipher clues, solve puzzles, and evade hostile entities to save his sister and uncover the truth.",
